## Kubernetes

Use `datus k8s` for namespace-scoped Kubernetes workload inspection, logs,
events, metrics, manifests, rollout status/restart, and scaling. The command
surface is kubectl-style but intentionally excludes cluster-scoped resources,
all-namespaces access, remote exec, port forwarding, and kubeconfig mutation.

